  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nAn alien has kidnapped Matt Damon, not knowing what lengths humanity goes through to retrieve him whenever he goes missing. This is not the first time it has happened to Matt Damon. The first was a car accident on New Year's Eve of 2002. He was the only one in the car when it crashed. Then he disappeared. It turned out a fan had him and it was like that movie \"Misery\". He was kept captive by fans, who wanted to keep him because he was famous. Now he was being held by aliens for the same reason.\nHumanity needs Matt Damon. He is the only one who can save us from the evil's of the universe.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 43,
